    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Doyle are delighted to present No. 29 Roselawn, a simply stunning five-bedroom detached family home, ideally tucked away in a private cul-de-sac within this mature and highly sought-after residential development.\n\nExtending to approximately 180 sq. m. (1,938 sq. ft.), this impressive home offers generous, well-proportioned accommodation throughout, combining bright, light-filled interiors with excellent living space and superb family-friendly surroundings.\n\nPresented in excellent condition, the property has been thoughtfully designed to provide comfortable and versatile family living. The accommodation includes a spacious living room, family room, and an inviting open-plan kitchen/living/dining area, together with five well-proportioned bedrooms, one of which benefits from an en-suite, a family bathroom and guest WC.\n\nA particular feature of this wonderful home is the generous outdoor space. The property enjoys front, side and rear gardens, with the private rear garden providing an excellent setting for outdoor entertaining, family life and relaxation. Mature planting further enhances the sense of privacy and seclusion.\n\nKey Features:\n\nApproximately 180 sq. m. (1,938 sq. ft.) of spacious accommodation\nDetached five-bedroom family residence\nPrivate cul-de-sac setting\nBright and light-filled interiors\nGenerous reception and living areas\nSpacious kitchen/living/dining area\nFive well-proportioned bedrooms\nEn-suite bedroom\nFamily bathroom\nGuest WC\nGenerous front, side and rear gardens\nPrivate and mature rear garden\nExcellent family accommodation\nHighly sought-after mature residential location\n \nRoselawn is a mature and highly sought-after residential area, ideally located just off the Tipper Road provides convenient access to the M7 motorway, making journeys to Dublin and surrounding areas straightforward. Within easy walking distance of Naas Main Street. Residents can enjoy a superb range of amenities close by, including a choice of primary and secondary schools, supermarkets, churches, stylish boutiques, shops, cafés, restaurants, bars, healthcare, leisure facilities and excellent public transport links.\n\nNo. 29 Roselawn offers a wonderful combination of space, privacy, versatile accommodation and a superb location, making it an ideal choice for modern family living."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall : - 7.14m x 1.18m\nA bright welcoming hallway with oak flooring, ornate coving & radiator cover.\n\n- - \n\n\nLiving Room : - 7.23m x 3.74m\nA fine living room with feature bay window, solid oak flooring, marble firepalace with inset gas fire, ornate coving & centre rose, velux window with inset lighting. Double glass door to kitchen/dining.\n\n- - \n\n\nFamily Room : - 5.38m x 2.85m\n2nd reception room with wood flooring, grantire fireplace with tile surround.\n\n- - \n\n\nGuest WC : - \nTiled floor, part tiled walls, w.c., w.h.b., window & understairs storage.\n\n- - \n\n\nKitchen Dining Living Room : - 8.17m x 4.25m\nKitchen: A stunning, light-filled triple aspect room with fitted country kitchen units, large island unit with ample additional storage, spot lighting, stainless steel sink unit & drainer, tiled floor & splash back, integrated fridge freezer & dishwasher, oven, hob & extractor fan. Portlain tiled floor & alarm. French doors lead to the rear garden.Dining Area:With coving, vertical designer radiator, double glass door to the living room.\n\n- - \n\n\nLanding : - \nWith carpet flooring, feature large window for light, hot press with storage, shelving & dual immersion.Access to the attic.\n\n- - \n\n\nMaster Bedroom 1 : - 4.26m x 3.06m\nA large master suite, facing the front of the property with carpet flooring, wall to ceiling built in wardrobes with vanity unit.\n\n- - \n\n\nEnsuite Bathroom : - \nWall & floor tiled ensuite with w.c., w.h.b. & shower.\n\n- - \n\n\nBedroom 2 : - 3.94m x 3.29m\nA large double room facing to the front with built in wardrobes and carpet flooring.\n\n- - \n\n\nBedroom 3 : - 3.99m x 2.72m\nA spacios double room facing to the rear with wood flooring, built in wardrobes & vanity unit.\n\n- - \n\n\nBedroom 4 : - 2.87m x 2.45m\nA large single facing the rear with wood flooring and built in wardrobes.\n\n- - \n\n\nBedroom 5: - 3.86m x 3.21m\nA large double facing the rear.\n\n- - \n\n\nBathroom : - 2.37m x 2.37m\nAn elegant fully tiled floor and walled family bathroom with free standing bath, pumped shower & guard, w.h.b., w.c., heated chrome towel rail, inset lighting & window.\n\n- - \n\n\nOutside : - \nFront: Laid to lawn and landscaped with colourful plant life. Walled with hedging and ample off street parking in the driveway. There is also a large side passage for additional parking space.Rear: Private, rear garden which is superbly maintained and fully landscaped. Laid to lawn and a colourful variety of plant life, shrubbery and hedging. There is also a detached garage and would be ideal for a variety of uses such as a home office. To the rear of the garage is a shed with boiler.\n\n- - \n\n\nAdditonal Information : - \n• Presented to the market in show house condition - both inside and out• Superbly spacious accommodation of c. 180 sq. m.• Highly sought after location - just off the Tipper Road• Detached garage to rear would be ideal for a variety of uses• Oil-fired central heating• Double-glazing• Alarm• Living room and family room• 5 bedrooms• Guest w.c., en-suite and main bathroom• Superbly landscaped and private rear garden\n\n- - \n\n\nDisclaimer : - \nThe above are issued by DNG Doyle Naas on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is taken in preparing particulars which are issued for guidance purposes only and neither the form nor the agent holds themselves responsible for any inaccuracies. The purchaser is advised to make their own arrangements to satisfy themselves with measurements, details and contents include conditions.\n\n"
      },
